  <office:text>
   <text:tracked-changes text:track-changes="true">
    <text:changed-region text:id="ct1"><text:insertion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Dana Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-01T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info></text:insertion></text:changed-region>
    <text:changed-region text:id="ct2"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Dana Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-01T10:05:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p>very </text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region>
    <text:changed-region text:id="ct3"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Sam Proofreader</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-02T09:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p> It was the age of foolishness.</text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region>
   </text:tracked-changes>
   <text:h text:outline-level="1">Chapter One</text:h>
   <text:p>It was the best of times, it was the <text:change text:change-id="ct2"/>worst of times.<text:change-start text:change-id="ct1"/> And so it went.<text:change-end text:change-id="ct1"/></text:p>
   <text:p>It was the age of wisdom.<text:change text:change-id="ct3"/></text:p>
   <text:p><office:annotation><dc:creator>Dana Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-10-01T11:00:00</dc:date><text:p>Is this <text:span text:style-name="T1">too</text:span> famous?</text:p></office:annotation>It was the epoch of belief.<office:annotation-end/></text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
